Package: jarvis-diag
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: jarvis-helper (= @VERSION@), network-manager, systemd, iproute2, iputils-ping, rfkill, pciutils, usbutils
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/mmAbdelhay/jarvis
Description: Jarvis OS diagnosis tools (MCP server)
 Health, logs, services, network and hardware information for the Jarvis
 agent, with secrets redacted before any text leaves the process.
